- Leo?

733
00:36:09,750 --> 00:36:10,667
Yes, Leo.

734
00:36:10,668 --> 00:36:13,044
- Is he ever that serious?
- Doesn't look like him.

735
00:36:13,045 --> 00:36:14,796
- Looks so serious.
- That's Leo.

736
00:36:14,797 --> 00:36:16,756
So intense.

737
00:36:16,757 --> 00:36:19,342
<i>- Has anyone else made out yet?</i>
- <i>Not yet.</i>

738
00:36:19,343 --> 00:36:20,760
- <i>No one?</i>
- <i>Right.</i>

739
00:36:20,761 --> 00:36:24,390
You can edit this out, but is it possible
they won't have sex after that?

740
00:36:25,141 --> 00:36:27,643
- It's still possible.
- I want to watch them do it!
